  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SecAdd.secOn_add | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SecAdd.secOn_add | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.SecAdd.secOn_add <;> assumption)
